  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "じめんを　すべるように　あいてを　こうげき。\nグラスフィールドの　とき\nかならず　せんせい　こうげき　できる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "지면에 미끄러지듯 상대를 공격한다.\n그래스필드일 때\n반드시 선제공격할 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在地面上滑行般地攻擊對手。\n在青草場地時，\n必定能夠發動先制攻擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le lanceur attaque l’ennemi en glissant sur le terrain.\nFrappe toujours en priorité si un Champ Herbu est actif.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Anwender rutscht über den Boden und greift das\nZiel an. Ermöglicht den Erstschlag, wenn ein Grasfeld\naktiv ist.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ataca al objetivo deslizándose sobre el terreno de\ncombate. Este movimiento tiene prioridad alta cuando\nel terreno está cubierto por un campo de hierba.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Chi la usa attacca il bersaglio scivolando sul terreno.\nSe utilizzata quando è attivo un Campo Erboso,\nha priorità alta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gliding on the ground, the user attacks the target.\nThis move always goes first on Grassy Terrain.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "地面を　滑るように　相手を　攻撃。\nグラスフィールドの時\n必ず　先制攻撃　できる。",
